Thermal PID Workbench

This project is derived from LLM-PID-Tuner by KINGSTON-115 and its contributors:
https://github.com/KINGSTON-115/llm-pid-tuner

The upstream Apache License, Version 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.
Upstream source, documentation and attribution remain in this distribution.
reference/original_system_id.py is an unchanged upstream identification snapshot;
its source archive and SHA-256 are recorded in reference/SOURCE.json.

Local modifications add corrected thermal FOPDT identification, SIMC PI tuning,
offline comparisons, a configurable project workflow, explicit parameter units,
gateway adapters, and related tests and documentation. See CHANGELOG.md.
Version 0.4 additionally adds a visual desktop application, persistent run records,
generic process quantities and units, integrating models, and compatibility routes.
The new workflow and results do not imply endorsement by upstream authors.
